Package: sauerbraten-nonfree-data
Architecture: all
Section: local/games
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, cube2-data
Description: Sauerbraten models and sounds that Debian's cube2-data leaves out
 cube2-data is the BananaBread content; the game code (cube2) also loads the original
 Sauerbraten's item, weapon, player and effect models and its sounds: the health, ammo, armour,
 boost, quad and teleporter pickups, the hud guns and held weapons, the player models (Mr. Fixit,
 Iron Snout, Ogro, Inky, Captain Cannon), gibs and debris, monsters, and the sounds. Without
 them the log says "could not load model" and "failed to load sample" and no gun is shown.
 These are the files of the Sauerbraten 2020_12_29 release not in cube2-data, in
 /usr/share/games/cube2/packages. Most are licensed CC BY-NC(-SA) or all rights reserved, so
 this package is for our LAN repository only (the ps3-licensed suite), never a public one. cube2
 does not depend on it.
